# Integer certificates for the quaternion comparison

Denominator-cleared candidate and inverse matrices, the integral Gram matrix,
and intermediate images in the retained Golay coordinates. The certificates
are checked in `Checks`; no mathematical claim follows from these tables alone.
The image columns are related to the existing 36 integral icosian generators
by both coefficient tables already published in `ComparisonData`.
-/

